I walk to the front counter.
I place my basket on the counter.
The cashier looks at the groceries.
The cashier asks, "Do you want a plastic bag?"
I say, "No need, I want a cloth bag."
I really like cloth bags.
The cashier gives me two cloth bags.
These are good sturdy bags.
I put the groceries into these two bags.
The cashier says the price, "Eight hundred rupees."
I look at the cashier.
I open my purse.
I take the cash.
I give eight hundred rupees to the cashier.
The cashier gives me the bill.
I pick up both bags.
I walk outside.
